module Formatter.Render.MakeRenderBox exposing (buildFlowBoxMeasured, makePBox, renderNodeBox)

{-| Box-model renderer — the sole backend. It renders an LPT node to
elm-format's `Box` (Tab + prefix arithmetic), returning `Err` for any construct
it cannot render (the caller, `Formatter.Render`'s private `renderChild`,
surfaces that `Err` — there is no fallback renderer, so it fails the whole
file).

It handles every top-level definition kind: leaves, record / array literals,
flows and nested flows, blocks, pipelines, binops, `when`/`if`/`let`,
signatures, and comments — each laid out to match elm-format.
-}

